author ai
file src/ui.rs
symbol end
lines 0 155
hash e35b5aad3f78f151
note Layout, once, for the whole frame. Each axis gets a fit pass bottom-up and a grow pass top-down; between the two axes, with widths final and heights not, wrapped text learns how many lines it takes; then one pass places every element and stores the rectangles for next frame's input. Floating elements are left out of every flow calculation and sized against the window instead.

