note What one id learned last frame, and the answer open gives back: hovered is 'it was the hit', clicked is that plus a press this frame, down is that the mouse went down on it and is still down, drag is the pointer movement since last frame while it is the active element, and rect is where it was last frame. Callable without creating an element, for a caller that needs to know it is hovered in order to decide what the element should look like.

