note The tree itself: the flat element list, which element is currently open, and last frame's rectangle, clip and content extent per id - that map is the whole of what survives a frame, and it is what every hit test and every scroll clamp reads. scroll_drag holds the id whose scrollbar thumb is being dragged and how far down the thumb the mouse grabbed it.

